Package: BayesCP
Type: Package
Title: Exact Bayesian Gaussian Change-Point Analysis with Reproducible Simulation Workflows
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Taiwo", "Adegoke", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "adegoketaiwom@gmail.com)
Description: Exact conjugate Bayesian inference for a single Gaussian change point
    with segment-specific means and a common variance. The package provides
    collapsed posterior computation, direct posterior simulation, prior-sensitivity
    analysis, operating-characteristic evaluation, validation, checkpointing,
    automatic recovery, and reproducible long-running simulation workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: graphics, grDevices, stats, utils
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/USERNAME/BayesCP
